### License Notice

This project (the `gcode_translator` package) is licensed under the MIT License and
ships **no** AGPL-covered material.

It can optionally make use of a separately compiled binary (`bgcode`), built from the
[Prusa3D libbgcode project](https://github.com/prusa3d/libbgcode), licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0). That binary is **not** part of this
MIT package: it is distributed as a separate, opt-in companion package under
[`companion/bgcode-linux/`](./companion/bgcode-linux/) and is installed only when the
user explicitly requests it (e.g. `pip install "gcode-translator[linux] @ git+..."`).

This external tool is **not included** in the MIT license, and users must comply with the
AGPL-3.0 when using or distributing the `bgcode` executable. The full license text ships
inside the companion package at
[companion/bgcode-linux/LICENSE.AGPL-3.0.txt](./companion/bgcode-linux/LICENSE.AGPL-3.0.txt)
and is also available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html.en .

### bgcode — Corresponding Source (AGPL-3.0 §6)

The `bgcode` binary shipped in the companion package
(`companion/bgcode-linux/gcode_translator_bgcode_linux/bgcode`) was built,
**unmodified**, from the Prusa3D libbgcode project. Its complete Corresponding Source
is the following public revision:

  Binary SHA-256: 15c6fe4d54defc4d375524452f433ff3f4e7a10e3b23f89c14096cd5484c1f4b
  Repository:     https://github.com/prusa3d/libbgcode
  Version:        libbgcode 0.2.0
  Commit:         5041c093b33e2748e76d6b326f2251310823f3df (branch main, 2025-02-20)
  Source tree:    https://github.com/prusa3d/libbgcode/tree/5041c093b33e2748e76d6b326f2251310823f3df

Build environment used to produce the shipped binary:

  Target:         ELF 64-bit x86-64, dynamically linked, GNU/Linux
  Toolchain:      GNU g++ 11.4.0
  Build system:   CMake 3.22.1
  Configure/build: CMake preset "default" (see the project's CMakePresets.json)
                   -> CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release, deps preset "default"

    # Reproduce (from a clean checkout of the commit above):
    git clone https://github.com/prusa3d/libbgcode
    cd libbgcode
    git checkout 5041c093b33e2748e76d6b326f2251310823f3df
    cmake --preset default        # configures deps + project (Release)
    cmake --build --preset default
    # resulting tool: build-default/src/LibBGCode/cmd/bgcode

**Written Offer:** The Corresponding Source for the exact version above is publicly
available at the commit link. In addition, for at least three (3) years from the date
of distribution, the author will provide, on request, a copy of the complete
Corresponding Source of this binary. Contact: david.herrmann@kit.edu

